sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports sending a SetDisplayMessageRequest<br>with a transactionId for a transaction that does not exist
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a display message for a specific transaction

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest (message.transactionId, message.priority)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: message.transactionId not omitted AND<br>message.priority is <Configured Priority>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = UnknownTransaction)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
